("Q1: Find and fix four mistakes") Tj T*
() Tj T*
("Q1\(a\) - E1/E2/E3") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E1: Docker Compose reported that services.web.port failed schema validation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E2: I changed port to ports because Compose expects the plural key for a list of published ports.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E3: The corrected compose file used ports and the build continued to the Dockerfile.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
("Q1\(b\) - E1/E2/E3") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E1: Docker could not find the image nginx:alpne.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E2: I changed alpne to alpine because alpine is the valid nginx image tag.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E3: The image metadata loaded successfully after the correction.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
("Q1\(c\) - E1/E2/E3") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E1: The build reported that /index.htm was not found.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E2: I changed index.htm to index.html because the actual web page file is named index.html.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E3: The image built successfully after correcting the COPY source.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
("Q1\(d\) - E1/E2/E3") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(E1: The published port mapped the host to container port 8080, so the page did not open.) Tj T*
