() Tj T*
("Q4: Health check") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The health check runs wget -q -O /dev/null http://127.0.0.1:80/ every 10 seconds, with a 3 second timeout and 3 retries.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(docker compose ps showed: Up 22 seconds \(healthy\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The check uses port 80 because it runs inside the container, where nginx listens on its internal port. HOST_PORT is only the host-side published port used to reach the container from outside.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
